 (B) CARRIER INTERNAL-sigma SIDE -- the wall (all touched)
====================================================================================================
ledger entry 8: Sohn+2017 (J/ApJS/229/20, A2029 field): 982 member rows, 924 with
   internal sigma (SDSS/Hectospec): sigma range 21-945 km/s, median frac err 20%.
   BUT: RELIABLE sigma only >~60 km/s (SDSS/Hectospec resolution; the handful of lower values carry
   the largest errors) -> the usable set is dE/E class, y<~0.3, predicted MI spread ~0.1-0.7%
   -> needs N~100,000 (estimator_power.py): the measurable members cannot carry the test.
ledger entry 9: Gannon+2024 LIVING UDG SPECTROSCOPIC CATALOG (github gannonjs/Published_Data;
   PUBLIC, downloaded): 38 UDGs total (30 cluster, 7 group, 1 field)
   with stellar sigma: 24 (of which 23 in cluster/group) | with GC sigma: 11
   stellar-sigma frac err: median 24%, range 6-46%
   => THE ENTIRE 2026 carrier reservoir with internal sigma ~ 23 objects at ~24% errors,
   NOT infall-tagged, heterogeneous instruments -- vs N~270-900 at <~10% needed (estimator_power.py).

